00:11:04.219 --> 00:11:07.127
they're all in alphabetical
order and by author

00:11:07.127 --> 00:11:09.785
they're all cataloged so I
know where to find something.

00:11:09.785 --> 00:11:11.364
just like that I go by authors more than

00:11:11.364 --> 00:11:13.342
the title of the book.

00:11:13.342 --> 00:11:17.406
Do you know that when I
started studying these books

00:11:17.406 --> 00:11:20.060
I really didn't know
very much about anything

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:21.646
I had two months high school.

00:11:21.646 --> 00:11:23.171
I was 26 years old.

00:11:23.171 --> 00:11:25.522
I had a bad work record, a bad attitude

00:11:25.522 --> 00:11:28.319
and and virtually no experience.

00:11:28.319 --> 00:11:30.346
And you know in a relatively
short period of time

00:11:30.346 --> 00:11:33.636
my income went from
4,000 to $175,000 a year.

00:11:33.636 --> 00:11:35.425
Then it went over a million.

00:11:35.425 --> 00:11:38.097
I'm going to share some
information with you that

00:11:38.097 --> 00:11:40.196
it could change the direction of your life

00:11:40.196 --> 00:11:41.812
like night and day.

00:11:41.812 --> 00:11:45.312
And when I say that I want you to really

00:11:45.312 --> 00:11:48.093
stop and take a look at your life.

00:11:48.093 --> 00:11:50.366
Take an honest look at your life.

00:11:50.366 --> 00:11:53.934
I was thinking just before
I start to make this

00:11:53.934 --> 00:11:56.493
we have actually been conditioned

00:11:56.493 --> 00:11:57.774
to kid with ourselves.

00:11:57.774 --> 00:11:59.378
To lie to ourselves.

00:11:59.378 --> 00:12:00.461
To not really

00:12:02.511 --> 00:12:06.449
take an honest look at
the results we're getting.

00:12:06.449 --> 00:12:11.281
I want you to take a real
honest look at your results.

00:12:11.281 --> 00:12:14.503
And when you look at them ask yourself,

00:12:14.503 --> 00:12:18.003
am I living the way I really want to live?

00:12:19.175 --> 00:12:21.532
You see most people aren't.

00:12:21.532 --> 00:12:23.387
One of the first questions I ask a person

00:12:23.387 --> 00:12:25.402
that comes to work with me I want to know

00:12:25.402 --> 00:12:27.841
what's the most they've
ever earned in a year.

00:12:27.841 --> 00:12:29.976
Now I really don't care what the answer is

00:12:29.976 --> 00:12:32.206
but I want to know what the answer is.

00:12:32.206 --> 00:12:33.706
Because you see if

00:12:36.529 --> 00:12:38.861
if a person says the most
I've ever earned in years

00:12:38.861 --> 00:12:42.647
is $50,000 I know where
their mind is programmed.

00:12:42.647 --> 00:12:46.618
If they tell me the most
I've ever earned is $250,000

00:12:46.618 --> 00:12:49.862
I know where they're programmed.

00:12:49.862 --> 00:12:53.334
And then I want to find
out what they want.

00:12:53.334 --> 00:12:56.084
And I know then what has to shift

00:12:58.159 --> 00:12:59.914
because their mind is programmed

00:12:59.914 --> 00:13:01.322
and if they're really going to live

00:13:01.322 --> 00:13:04.222
the way they want to live they

00:13:04.222 --> 00:13:06.895
they've got to change the program.

00:13:06.895 --> 00:13:08.670
And if they don't change the program

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.584
then nothing really happens.

00:13:10.584 --> 00:13:13.284
I want to suggest that to
make up your mind you're going

00:13:13.284 --> 00:13:15.320
to get in what we call the success zone.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:18.220
Yet it's a way of thinking, now get this.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:22.020
If 95, 96 percent of the
population are blowing it

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:25.053
if one percent of the
population are earning about 95%

00:13:25.053 --> 00:13:26.201
of all the money you're not going to get

00:13:26.201 --> 00:13:28.686
a whole lot of people agree
with what you're doing.

00:13:28.686 --> 00:13:31.457
Most people are going to
look at you kind of strange,

00:13:31.457 --> 00:13:32.730
what are you going there for?

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:33.980
You went there last month.

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.462
What are you listening to that for?

00:13:35.462 --> 00:13:36.694
You listened to that before.

00:13:36.694 --> 00:13:37.848
What are you reading?

00:13:37.848 --> 00:13:39.389
What do you read the same
book over and over for?

00:13:39.389 --> 00:13:40.920
They don't understand.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.974
And you see they're
advertising their ignorance

00:13:42.974 --> 00:13:44.527
by the questions they ask.

00:13:44.527 --> 00:13:47.045
When we get into the success zone

00:13:47.045 --> 00:13:48.879
everything in our life starts to change.

00:13:48.879 --> 00:13:50.179
But understand this

00:13:50.179 --> 00:13:51.781
you're going to be a bit of an oddball.

00:13:51.781 --> 00:13:54.360
You're out of the box,
you're not one of the masses.

00:13:54.360 --> 00:13:56.111
And when you get out of the box

00:13:56.111 --> 00:13:58.201
your whole world starts to shift.

00:13:58.201 --> 00:14:01.460
There's a box and there's a leader.

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.979
Leader get people excited
about improving the

00:14:04.979 --> 00:14:07.191
quality of whatever it is themselves,

00:14:07.191 --> 00:14:10.166
their work, whatever they're doing.

00:14:10.166 --> 00:14:14.168
People follow leaders
because they want to.

00:14:14.168 --> 00:14:17.234
People don't follow leaders
because they have to.

00:14:17.234 --> 00:14:19.552
That becomes a form of dictatorship

00:14:19.552 --> 00:14:21.681
and that never works.

00:14:21.681 --> 00:14:25.608
The great leaders people want to follow.

00:14:25.608 --> 00:14:27.608
And leaders inspire you,

00:14:29.182 --> 00:14:31.816
leaders pull the very best out of you.

00:14:31.816 --> 00:14:33.339
Leaders know how to look inside

00:14:33.339 --> 00:14:35.892
and bring the best of you to the surface.

00:14:35.892 --> 00:14:40.513
Cause you to look a a higher
side of your own personality.

00:14:40.513 --> 00:14:43.988
What the world is always
is looking for its leader.

00:14:43.988 --> 00:14:45.705
It's silly, who's going to lead the leader

00:14:45.705 --> 00:14:46.901
is going to lead.

00:14:46.901 --> 00:14:48.202
(laughs)

00:14:48.202 --> 00:14:50.209
And the leader just automatically emerges.

00:14:50.209 --> 00:14:53.928
If they threw 50 of us into a committee

00:14:53.928 --> 00:14:56.935
and say you don't have to elect a leader

00:14:56.935 --> 00:14:59.166
elect one but the leader is going to lead

00:14:59.166 --> 00:15:01.870
and that probably isn't
the one that's elected.

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:03.341
- [Man] Yeah so true.

00:15:03.341 --> 00:15:05.442
Leader's don't stop they know how to get

00:15:05.442 --> 00:15:07.519
the best out of people.

00:15:07.519 --> 00:15:10.201
I want to talk to you
about where you're going

00:15:10.201 --> 00:15:12.087
and what you want to do with your life.

00:15:12.087 --> 00:15:16.154
You see, most people never
go after what they want

00:15:16.154 --> 00:15:18.480
because they don't know every step

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:20.997
they have to take to get there.

00:15:20.997 --> 00:15:23.560
I want you to think of a person

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.591
going up the side of a wall of ice.

00:15:26.591 --> 00:15:29.123
Now the only rule for reaching a goal

00:15:29.123 --> 00:15:31.123
that you have to know is

00:15:32.272 --> 00:15:33.996
knowing where you're going

00:15:33.996 --> 00:15:36.782
and knowing that you're
going to get there.

00:15:36.782 --> 00:15:40.578
You do not have to know how
you're going to get there.

00:15:40.578 --> 00:15:42.348
Now pay attention to this for a moment.

00:15:42.348 --> 00:15:45.429
Imagine the climber has all his equipment,

00:15:45.429 --> 00:15:48.512
he's got his crampons,
he's got his climbing rope,

00:15:48.512 --> 00:15:51.602
his hardware, his ice access.

00:15:51.602 --> 00:15:54.149
How does he get to the top?

00:15:54.149 --> 00:15:56.968
He's standing on the
ground and he's looking at

00:15:56.968 --> 00:16:00.711
maybe a hundred foot vertical wall of ice.

00:16:00.711 --> 00:16:04.423
He looks up and he has absolutely no idea

00:16:04.423 --> 00:16:06.408
the path that he's going to take.

00:16:06.408 --> 00:16:09.664
He just sees himself at the top.

00:16:09.664 --> 00:16:12.858
He reaches up and he puts one pick in

00:16:12.858 --> 00:16:14.670
and then another pick.

00:16:14.670 --> 00:16:17.867
Then he raises one foot
and then the other.

00:16:17.867 --> 00:16:21.037
Now he's not standing
on the ground any longer

00:16:21.037 --> 00:16:25.183
he's suspended on the wall
on a vertical wall of ice

00:16:25.183 --> 00:16:27.016
that goes up 100 feet.

00:16:28.338 --> 00:16:30.670
He adapts to the changes that is

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:32.773
taking place in his environment

00:16:32.773 --> 00:16:36.807
and then and only then
does he see the next step.

00:16:36.807 --> 00:16:39.040
And he moves this pick then this pick,

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.292
then this foot then this foot.

00:16:41.292 --> 00:16:44.231
Now that's how he gets to the top

00:16:44.231 --> 00:16:46.067
a step at a time.

00:16:46.067 --> 00:16:48.612
And that's how you're
going to get to your goal.

00:16:48.612 --> 00:16:51.673
You just have to know
the first step to take

00:16:51.673 --> 00:16:53.611
and when you take that step

00:16:53.611 --> 00:16:56.695
you're going to find that your
conditions, your circumstance

00:16:56.695 --> 00:16:58.364
and environment will change.

00:16:58.364 --> 00:17:02.765
Then you see how you have
to make the next step.

00:17:02.765 --> 00:17:05.069
It's a matter of adapting all the time

00:17:05.069 --> 00:17:07.525
you only have to know two things.

00:17:07.525 --> 00:17:09.555
You have to know where you're going

00:17:09.555 --> 00:17:11.983
and you have to know that
you're going to get there.

00:17:11.983 --> 00:17:13.822
You've got to see it in your mind.

00:17:13.822 --> 00:17:15.848
Now this is the beautiful scenario

00:17:15.848 --> 00:17:17.415
this is what it's all about.

00:17:17.415 --> 00:17:20.707
Save that in your mind
and think of it often

00:17:20.707 --> 00:17:23.069
think every time you think of your goal

00:17:23.069 --> 00:17:25.134
and you're trying to figure
out how you're going to do it

00:17:25.134 --> 00:17:27.248
think of that vertical wall of ice.

00:17:27.248 --> 00:17:28.485
What's the next step?

00:17:28.485 --> 00:17:30.128
That's all you really have to know.

00:17:30.128 --> 00:17:34.804
One step at a time and you'll
get to wherever you're going.

00:17:34.804 --> 00:17:37.579
That's how Hillary got to
the top of Mount Everest.

00:17:37.579 --> 00:17:41.123
In Napoleon Hill's book,
Think And Grow Rich

00:17:41.123 --> 00:17:44.503
he said now right here we
come to a rather strange fact.

00:17:44.503 --> 00:17:47.882
We tend to minimize the things we can do,

00:17:47.882 --> 00:17:49.789
the goals we can accomplish.

00:17:49.789 --> 00:17:51.049
And for some equally strange reason

00:17:51.049 --> 00:17:53.145
we think other people can
accomplish things that we cannot.

00:17:53.145 --> 00:17:56.112
And he points out that
there's a difference

00:17:56.112 --> 00:17:58.417
between wishing proofing and
being ready to receive them.

00:17:58.417 --> 00:18:00.321
So no one's ready for a thing until

00:18:00.321 --> 00:18:02.488
they believe that they can acquire it.

00:18:02.488 --> 00:18:05.901
The state of mind must be
belief and not mere of a wish.

00:18:05.901 --> 00:18:09.249
Yeah he was under consciousness
and said open-mindedness is

00:18:09.249 --> 00:18:10.599
essential to belief.

00:18:10.599 --> 00:18:14.521
Closed minds will not inspire
faith courage orderly.

00:18:14.521 --> 00:18:17.065
- [Narrator] A German engineer
by the name of Karl Benz

00:18:17.065 --> 00:18:18.072
had a fantasy

00:18:18.072 --> 00:18:21.072
and he literally turned
his fantasy into a fact.

00:18:21.072 --> 00:18:23.489
And in January 1886 Karl Benz

00:18:25.049 --> 00:18:28.283
was issued a patent for
the Benz motor carriage

00:18:28.283 --> 00:18:31.359
and the age of the automobile had done.

00:18:31.359 --> 00:18:35.139
This is a replica of
that magnificent machine.

00:18:35.139 --> 00:18:39.517
And you know, before Benz
ever turned his fantasy

00:18:39.517 --> 00:18:42.760
into a theory, even certainly long before

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.571
he turned it into a fact,
he had to ask himself

00:18:45.571 --> 00:18:47.829
a couple of questions that you and I

00:18:47.829 --> 00:18:49.984
and every other dreamer
will have to go through.

00:18:49.984 --> 00:18:53.450
He had to ask himself,
am I able to do this?

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:55.938
Well he seemed to have
that innate awareness

00:18:55.938 --> 00:18:58.693
of this higher self this image
of perfection within him.

00:18:58.693 --> 00:19:01.196
And he saw himself as a
person that was actually

00:19:01.196 --> 00:19:04.386
able to take and turn
the fantasy into effect.

00:19:04.386 --> 00:19:06.902
Now, he must have been
a pretty courageous guy

00:19:06.902 --> 00:19:10.141
because there were no horseless
carriages in those days.

00:19:10.141 --> 00:19:13.452
But then he had to ask
himself, am I willing?

00:19:13.452 --> 00:19:15.124
And you see, he'd ask
himself, am I willing

00:19:15.124 --> 00:19:18.606
to accept the ridicule
that I'm bound to get?

00:19:18.606 --> 00:19:21.366
Am I willing to accept the failures?

00:19:21.366 --> 00:19:23.631
Well, he said yes I am willing.

00:19:23.631 --> 00:19:26.944
He was willing to pay the ultimate price

00:19:26.944 --> 00:19:30.332
to turn his fantasy into a fact.

00:19:30.332 --> 00:19:33.093
And ridicule he got,
his own partner thought

00:19:33.093 --> 00:19:34.662
he had gone mad.

00:19:34.662 --> 00:19:37.714
And he had to find himself
a more congenial colleague

00:19:37.714 --> 00:19:38.620
to work with.

00:19:38.620 --> 00:19:41.472
He would take this thing
out in the evening,

00:19:41.472 --> 00:19:42.867
he'd take it out at night

00:19:42.867 --> 00:19:44.126
so no one would see him.

00:19:44.126 --> 00:19:46.501
He escaped some of the ridicule.

00:19:46.501 --> 00:19:49.425
And time after time he
couldn't get it going

00:19:49.425 --> 00:19:51.104
he had to push it back.

00:19:51.104 --> 00:19:53.733
But it never dawned on
him that he would not

00:19:53.733 --> 00:19:56.150
ultimately realize his dream.

00:19:57.364 --> 00:20:00.460
When this magnificent
machine completed its first

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:03.135
long journey with Benz at the wheel

00:20:03.135 --> 00:20:05.970
every beat of the engine
found an answering echo

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.497
in the heart of the driver

00:20:07.497 --> 00:20:10.506
as every turn of the
wheels brought him closer

00:20:10.506 --> 00:20:11.696
to his goal.

00:20:11.696 --> 00:20:14.362
To the realization of what once

00:20:14.362 --> 00:20:15.612
was a fantasy.

00:20:16.773 --> 00:20:19.459
Now in order for you to turn
your fantasies into a fact

00:20:19.459 --> 00:20:22.569
you have to go through
exactly the same process

00:20:22.569 --> 00:20:23.986
as Carl Benz.

00:20:23.986 --> 00:20:26.488
And if you do go through the same process

00:20:26.488 --> 00:20:28.937
you'll meet with exactly the same success

00:20:28.937 --> 00:20:32.519
regardless of the opposition
you might come up against.

00:20:32.519 --> 00:20:35.602
You have to ask, am I able to turn this

00:20:35.602 --> 00:20:37.935
fantasy of mine into a fact?

00:20:39.169 --> 00:20:40.664
Can I actually realize it?

00:20:40.664 --> 00:20:43.343
Can I turn my dreams into reality?

00:20:43.343 --> 00:20:45.655
Now you're either going
to say, yes I'm able to.

00:20:45.655 --> 00:20:46.636
Or, no I'm not.

00:20:46.636 --> 00:20:48.644
If you realize you are able, if you have

00:20:48.644 --> 00:20:50.554
an understanding of this potential,

00:20:50.554 --> 00:20:53.151
this power within you then
you have to ask yourself,

00:20:53.151 --> 00:20:54.689
are you willing?

00:20:54.689 --> 00:20:56.746
And there's a long series of tests there

00:20:56.746 --> 00:20:59.282
you don't even know what you're
going to come up against.

00:20:59.282 --> 00:21:00.402
One thing is for certain

00:21:00.402 --> 00:21:02.102
you'll come up against ridicule.

00:21:02.102 --> 00:21:03.221
You may have to move

00:21:03.221 --> 00:21:05.187
you may have to do all kinds of things

00:21:05.187 --> 00:21:06.905
that you don't even think about.

00:21:06.905 --> 00:21:10.044
You have to be willing to
do whatever is required

00:21:10.044 --> 00:21:13.918
if you really want to turn
your fantasy into a fact.

00:21:13.918 --> 00:21:15.973
The second you say, yes I'm willing

00:21:15.973 --> 00:21:19.556
at that instant you've
created your theory.

